    "VNM 2025: CafeF reports 429 = 0 and its 400 equals equity attributable to the parent (30,685,382,906,886). The audited balance sheet (page 9) shows 429 = 3,797,632,379,221 and total equity 34,483,015,286,107, consistent with correction CORR-VNM-2025-EQUITY-FULLREVIEW of the financial seed. A correction is recorded for 429.",
